*/////////////////////////////////////////////////
* LT1357  25MHz, 600V/µs Operational Amplifier  //
*/////////////////////////////////////////////////
*
* connections:     non-inverting input
*                  |   inverting input
*                  |   |   positive power supply
*                  |   |   |   negative power supply
*                  |   |   |   |   output
*                  |   |   |   |   |
*                  |   |   |   |   |
.SUBCKT LT1357     3   2   7   4   6 
* INPUT
RC1 7  80 6.3662E+02
RC2 7  90 6.3662E+02
Q1  80 2  10 QM1 
Q2  90 3  11 QM2 
CIN 2  3  2.0000E-12
*INPUT POLE AT 150MHZ
C1  80 90 0.834E-12

*RE1 10 12 +6.2798E+02
*RE2 11 12 +6.2798E+02
