EB  1  0  8  0  1
RO2 1  6  46
RF  8  99 2000
CF  99 6  7.5E-12
* OUTPUT 
ECL 18 1  6  1  0.395
Q3  7  18 8  QM3
Q4  4  18 8  QM4
